;; Mega Man's mini game (the station stage and Dark Mega Man's room): five screens of station
;; corridor, then a short corridor and the boss room, each behind a two-tile shutter (Mega Man 2's
;; two boss shutters). stage.ts loads it with ?raw, so it is not
;; in the level library, the dev level select or the campaign. The robots and the weapon capsule
;; are the mini game's own entity types (World's `extraEntities`); `shutter` and `dark-megaman` are
;; taken out of the map, and the scene places them itself. Columns 80's and 95's doorways (rows
;; 11-12) are the shutters, solid until they open. scrollStop keeps the corridor out of sight until
;; the first shutter opens; the camera then scrolls over and locks on columns 80-95 (both shutters
;; in sight), and at the second on the boss room, columns 95-110.
id: mm-station
name: STATION ESCAPE
world: 3
stage: 1
theme: station
music: mm-station
time: 400
start: 2,12
startMode: stand
camera: scroll

